<div class="diff-line diff-delete"><span class="diff-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><p><del>A <span class=grammar>parameter-declaration-clause</span> of the form <code nohighlight><span class=grammar>parameter-declaration-list</span> ...</code> is deprecated (<a href="https://timsong-cpp.github.io/cppwp/n5050/dcl.fct">[dcl.fct]</a>).</del></p></div>
